t;span style=&quot;color:#c00000;font-size:19px;font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;SOLAR BASED IOT BASED WIRELESS EV CHARGING STATION&lt;/span&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=#ffcb2d;strokeColor=#0c0c0c;strokeWidth=4.0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=5;spacingRight=5;spacingTop=4;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="396.8" y="30.2" width="740.8" height="37.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n10" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000;font-size:16px;font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;PROBLEM:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000;font-size:16px;font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt; Autonomous EVs will not have a person to stick in the charging cable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#00b050;font-size:16px;font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;SOLUTION:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000;font-size:16px;font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt; Wireless Charging which will not require a human to be with EV.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000;font-size:16px;font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=#ffff66;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=2.0;dashed=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingRight=5;spacingTop=4;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="34.0" y="75.6" width="238.1" height="120.9" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n11" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000;font-size:16px;font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;PROBLEM:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000;font-size:16px;font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt; How to make Charging station function autonomously ?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#00b050;font-size:16px;font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;SOLUTION:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000;font-size:16px;font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt; To use an IoT system which will directly start charging the EV with one human labour requirement who will see payment and will turn on charging.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000;font-size:16px;font-family:Calibri&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=#ffff66;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=2.0;dashed=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingRight=5;spacingTop=4;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="34.0" y="207.9" width="238.1" height="177.6" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n12" value="" style="shape=image;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/jpeg,;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="907.1" y="88.4" width="283.5" height="164.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n13" value="" style="shape=image;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/jpeg,;rotation=90;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1351.2" y="616.6" width="207.9" height="93.3" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n14" value="" style="shape=image;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/jpeg,;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1366.9" y="332.6" width="126.0" height="99.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n15" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000;font-size:16px;font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;12 V BATTERY&lt;/span&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingRight=5;spacingTop=4;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1366.9" y="431.7" width="126.0" height="32.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n16" value="" style="shape=image;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/jpeg,;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1082.7" y="625.0" width="164.6" height="44.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n17" value="" style="shape=image;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/jpeg,;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="899.5" y="699.2" width="181.4" height